{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relaxing Idle Card Collection Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong><br>In this idle card game, you can expand your collection and grow your fortune without staring at the screen for hours.<br>Through simple idle mechanics and strategic decisions, you can automatically acquire cards, complete tasks, and build your very own card gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Collection</strong>: Earn coins and resources even while offline\u2014effortless and beginner\u2011friendly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Trading</strong>: Sell your extra cards on the market, track price fluctuations, and make a profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Pricing System</strong>: Market prices change over time\u2014buy low, sell high, and maximize the value of your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Exploration</strong>: Unlock new areas and obtain rare cards through exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Album &amp; Achievements</strong>: Complete card sets to unlock achievement and special rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Is This Game For?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy collecting, trading, and idle gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual players looking for an easy\u2011to\u2011pick\u2011up game with long\u2011term growth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your journey to build the ultimate card collection and watch your wealth grow!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923240?t=1756169948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/60ff642d2ea8e8a3985dea77b7e66270d8e87f65/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756169948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/fd86540df6f203fb6e795a2818de7949959b1f82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756169948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/fd86540df6f203fb6e795a2818de7949959b1f82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756169948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Player Notes</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong>: The game focuses on <strong>idle card collection</strong>. A traditional card battle system is <strong>not currently planned</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Window Control</strong>: The game window can be moved by <strong>right-clicking and dragging</strong> with the mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.poster.avif?t=1756169948\" width=320 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.webm?t=1756169948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923240/extras/236c69de0c61d737aae5ae252ac04d95.mp4?t=1756169948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Cards &amp; Animations</strong>: Some <strong>gold cards and related animations</strong> are <strong>not yet fully implemented</strong>. These will 